  "question_stem": "A fair red spinner has four sides, numbered $1, 2, 3, 3$. A fair blue spinner has three sides, numbered $-1, 0, 2$. When a spinner is spun, the score is the number on the side on which it lands. The spinners are spun at the same time. The random variable $X$ denotes the score on the red spinner minus the score on the blue spinner.",
